<title>FINLAND: Aamulehti Jan-April profit rises 59 pct.</title>
<headline>Aamulehti Jan-April profit rises 59 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	     51 vs 32</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.99 vs 3.21</p>
<p> Net sales					    536 vs 517</p>
<p> Operating profit				    50 vs 41</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of nine analysts's forecasts for Finnish media group Aamulehti-Yhtyma's profit before extras, tax was 43 million markka (range 33-55 million markka).  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	  97 vs 79</p>
<p> Depreciation					  47 vs 37</p>
<p> Net financial items			   gain 1 vs 9 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			  gain 39 vs nil</p>
<p> Minorities					   nil vs nil</p>
<p> Taxes						   17 vs 9</p>
<p> Net profit					    73 vs 23</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		49 vs 45</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Aamulehti-Yhtyma Oy.</p>
<p>It is due to merge with commercial television station MTV Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
